---
---
<html lang="en">
  <head>
    <meta charset="utf-8" />
    <link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg?v=2" />
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
    <title>System Guide | EverywhereJob</title>
    <style>
      body { font-family: -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, "Segoe UI", Roboto, sans-serif; background-color: #09090b; color: #e4e4e7; line-height: 1.6; margin: 0; padding-bottom: 0; }
      .site-header { background: #18181b; border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a; padding: 1rem 1.5rem; position: sticky; top: 0; z-index: 100; margin-bottom: 3rem; }
      .header-container { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: space-between; }
      .logo-link { display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.5rem; text-decoration: none; }
      .logo-text { font-weight: 700; font-size: 1.1rem; color: #ffffff; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      .logo-highlight { color: #10b981; }
      .nav-text-link { color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 500; font-size: 0.9rem; }
      .nav-text-link:hover { color: #ffffff; }
      .get-started-btn { background: #10b981; color: #09090b; padding: 0.5rem 1rem; border-radius: 4px; text-decoration: none; font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.85rem; }
      
      .wrapper { max-width: 760px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 1.5rem 4rem 1.5rem; }
      .card { background: #18181b; border-radius: 6px; padding: 2.5rem; border: 1px solid #27272a; }
      h1 { font-size: 2rem; color: #ffffff; margin-top: 0; margin-bottom: 1.5rem; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: -0.02em; text-transform: uppercase; }
      h2 { font-size: 1.25rem; color: #10b981; border-bottom: 1px solid #27272a; padding-bottom: 0.5rem; margin-top: 2rem; }
      p { color: #a1a1aa; font-size: 1rem; }
      
      .contact-pane { background: #18181b; color: #e4e4e7; padding: 4rem 1.5rem; text-align: center; border-top: 1px solid #27272a; }
    </style>
  </head>
  <body>
    <header class="site-header">
      <div class="header-container">
        <a href="/" class="logo-link"><span class="logo-text">Everywhere<span class="logo-highlight">Job</span></span></a>
        <div style="display: flex; gap: 1.5rem; align-items: center;">
          <a href="/resources" class="nav-text-link">Resources</a>
          <a href="/guide" class="get-started-btn">Get Started</a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </header>

    <div class="wrapper">
      <div class="card">
        <h1>How to Use EverywhereJob</h1>
        <p>Follow these steps to compare countries and plan your move.</p>
        
        <h2>Step 1: Find Your Role or Destination</h2>
        <p>Search for your current job title or the country you want to move to to see average salaries and costs.</p>

        <h2>Step 2: Check Visa Requirements</h2>
        <p>Look at the specific visa options available. Remember that moving as a remote worker often requires a different visa than getting hired locally.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </body>
  <footer class="contact-pane">
      <div class="contact-container">
        <!-- Your existing contact form stays here -->
        
        <div style="display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 1.5rem; margin-top: 3rem; margin-bottom: 1rem;">
          <a href="/about" style="color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;">About Us</a>
          <a href="/resources" style="color: #a1a1aa; text-decoration: none; font-size: 0.9rem; font-weight: 500;">Resources</a>
        </div>
        <p style="margin: 0; font-size: 0.75rem; color: #52525b;">EverywhereJob v2.4.0 — Compiled from official government portals and global salary reports.</p>
      </div>
    </footer>
</html>